@baseUrl = http://localhost:5209/api/booking

### 1. View Initial Seeding Data Check (Optional - Test Route Availability)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. Successfully Book a Room (Alpha Developers [Size 10] into Grand Boardroom [Capacity 12])
POST {{baseUrl}}/book
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "teamId": 1,
  "roomId": 1,
  "startTime": "2026-07-15T10:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2026-07-15T11:00:00Z"
}

###

### 3. Test Failure: Overlap Check (Try booking the same room during the exact same time window)
POST {{baseUrl}}/book
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "teamId": 3,
  "roomId": 1,
  "startTime": "2026-07-15T10:30:00Z",
  "endTime": "2026-07-15T11:30:00Z"
}

###

### 4. Test Failure: Capacity Filter (Try fitting Alpha Devs [Size 10] into Focus Room [Capacity 6])
POST {{baseUrl}}/book
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "teamId": 1,
  "roomId": 7,
  "startTime": "2026-07-15T14:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2026-07-15T15:00:00Z"
}

###

### 5. Join the Waitlist (Gamma DevOps Team [Size 8] requests the full 10:00 to 11:00 slot)
POST {{baseUrl}}/waitlist
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "teamId": 2,
  "targetStartTime": "2026-07-15T10:00:00Z",
  "targetEndTime": "2026-07-15T11:00:00Z"
}

###

### 6. Cancel the First Booking (This should instantly auto-allocate the waitlisted team)
# NOTE: Replace '1' with the exact booking ID returned from Step 2 if it differs.
POST {{baseUrl}}/cancel/1
Content-Type: application/json
